637
00:32:51,141 --> 00:32:58,140
Some estimates say there have been over 150 million games of Clue sold.

638
00:32:58,141 --> 00:33:03,140
Whether you're trying to figure out if it was Colonel Mustard with the candlestick in the library

639
00:33:03,141 --> 00:33:08,140
or how to conquer the world, the appeal of the contest of strategy

640
00:33:08,141 --> 00:33:11,140
will always be among our top games.

