666
00:34:21,141 --> 00:34:24,140
Creating an Etch-a-Sketch rendition is a multi-step process.

667
00:34:24,141 --> 00:34:27,140
First, I am provided with a reference photo from the client

668
00:34:27,141 --> 00:34:30,140
as a one-to-one scale reference photo

669
00:34:30,141 --> 00:34:32,140
to the size of the Etch-a-Sketch screen.

