00:34:36,141 --> 00:34:39,440
And I'm also going to use a larger version of the photo

672
00:34:39,441 --> 00:34:42,640
so that I can pay attention to more intricate details

673
00:34:42,641 --> 00:34:45,940
that may not show up in the one-to-one scale reference photo.

674
00:34:45,941 --> 00:34:49,740
Etch-a-Sketch is a unique artistic medium.

675
00:34:49,741 --> 00:34:53,240
The drawing is comprised of one continuous line.

676
00:34:53,241 --> 00:34:56,040
It is an extremely unforgiving medium,

677
00:34:56,041 --> 00:34:59,740
so you have to be really confident and commit entirely

678
00:34:59,741 --> 00:35:01,540
to the line that you're drawing.

679
00:35:01,541 --> 00:35:03,340
I want to get to the facial details first,

680
00:35:03,341 --> 00:35:06,380
because if I make a mistake, I want to make it early.

